# Voice Invocations (Android)

Voice Invocations is a Wearables-level stream and needs no DeviceSession or runtime camera/microphone permission. Validate intents in `onCreate` and `onNewIntent`, retain one app-scoped auto-starting stream, acknowledge every `LaunchApp` exactly once, and call `close()` during cleanup. The feature is experimental.
